    Since CrofAI is working on patching the fingerprints mentioned here, our claims come with <strong
      >independently verifiable attestations</strong
    > published on GitHub: <a
      href="https://github.com/KTibow/crof-is-an-openrouter-wrapper/releases/tag/probe-34768920690"
      >one from the morning of September 13</a
    > (run <a
      href="https://github.com/KTibow/crof-is-an-openrouter-wrapper/actions/runs/34768920690"
      >34768920690</a
    >), <a
      href="https://github.com/KTibow/crof-is-an-openrouter-wrapper/releases/tag/probe-34804687001"
