      href="https://github.com/KTibow/crof-is-an-openrouter-wrapper/commit/1ec3ef09f007d6c9d38a6d845520aad1e68f96ab"
      >1ec3ef0</a
    >. The most common result for every model above is the same in all three. You're encouraged to
    ask your agent to use <code>gh</code> to verify it. If that's not enough, we have more reasons to
    be suspicious:
